title: Ruby
---
<<wait 0.1>>
<<if $day == 1 && $hasUnpacked == false>>
    <<jump Ruby_Day1>>
<<elseif $day == 1 && $hasUnpacked == true>>
    <<jump Ruby_Day1_afterUnpacking>>
<<elseif $day == 2>>
    <<jump Ruby_Day2>>
<<elseif $day == 3>>
    <<jump Ruby_Day2>>
<<elseif $day == 4>>
    <<jump Ruby_Day2>>
<<elseif $day == 5 && $hasSnuckOut == false>>
    <<jump Ruby_Day2>>
<<elseif $day == 5 && $hasSnuckOut == true>>
    <<jump Ruby_Final>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Ruby_Day1
---
Ruby: Hey Ernest! I just finished unpacking my bag, you should do the same before exploring the camp!
<<if $talkedToRuby == false>>
    <<set $talkedToRuby = true>>
    <<set $peopleMet = $peopleMet + 1>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Ruby_Day1_afterUnpacking
---
Ruby: Have you checked out the camp? You should go explore!
<<if $talkedToRuby == false>>
    <<set $talkedToRuby = true>>
    <<set $peopleMet = $peopleMet + 1>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Ruby_Day2
---
Ruby: Good morning Ernest! Have you seen Talia's game of cards yet? You should go check it out! 
===

title: Ruby_Final
---
Ruby: Are you ready to go home, Ernest?
    -> Yes, I'm ready to sleep in my own bed again. 
    -> I'll miss this place, but we have to leave soon, don't we? 
<<set $endScene = true>>
===
